---
title: "Auction Lifecycle State Machine (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_initialized: initialize() by Legion operator
    q_initialized --> q_active: block.timestamp >= startTime
    q_active --> q_refund_period: block.timestamp > endTime
    q_refund_period --> q_results_init: initializePublishSaleResults() after refundEndTime
    q_results_init --> q_results_published: publishSaleResults() with private key
    q_results_published --> q_tokens_supplied: supplyTokens() by projectAdmin
    q_tokens_supplied --> q_distribution: investors call claimTokenAllocation()
    q_distribution --> [*]: all claims processed

    q_active --> q_canceled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_refund_period --> q_canceled: cancel() by projectAdmin (before lock)
    q_canceled --> q_refunds: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled() by investors
    q_refunds --> [*]: all refunds processed

    q_results_published --> q_excess_claims: withdrawExcessInvestedCapital() by investors
    q_tokens_supplied --> q_capital_withdrawn: withdrawRaisedCapital() by projectAdmin

    note right of q_active
        INV-001: active period: startTime <= now <= endTime (invest allowed)
        INV-002: refund period: endTime < now <= refundEndTime
        INV-003: cancel impossible after initializePublishSaleResults (cancelLocked)
        INV-004: capital withdrawal requires both tokensSupplied AND refundEndTime passed
        INV-005: private key release enables public bid verification
    end note
